The themes in packages/ rebuild the official Slidev themes (https://github.com/slidevjs/themes),
which are licensed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2021 Slidev.js Team

Original designs:

- seriph: Anthony Fu (https://github.com/antfu)
- shibainu and bricks: iiiiiiinès (https://github.com/iiiiiiines)
- apple-basic: Jeremy Meissner (https://github.com/JeremyMeissner)

What is ported: the layout names and slots, the CSS values, the font settings and the eleven
polygon shapes of bricks. The Angular components are new code.

Assets: the images and other assets of the Slidev themes are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
(non-commercial). None of them was copied or embedded in this repository. Where an original draws a
picture, the port draws its own CSS gradients. Each package README says what is different.

